<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-S.Korean July trade deficit narrows sharply.</title>
<headline>TABLE-S.Korean July trade deficit narrows sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's customs-cleared trade deficit  in July narrowed to $806 million from $2.83 billion a year earlier,  provisional trade ministry statistics showed on Friday.</p>
<p>					JUL 97    JUN 97    JUL 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance		   -806	 +44    -2,832</p>
<p>    FOB exports		   11,848    12,295     9,897</p>
<p>    CIF imports		   12,654    12,252    12,729</p>
<p>NOTE: in millions of dollars, June figures revised</p>
</text>
